---

<Layout
  title="AI 项目进度"
  description="AI干货家老明正在推进的公开 AI 项目：AI 小说、法考学习、股票投资记录、长期记忆库 OS、内容自动化和个人网站。"
  pubDate={new Date('2026-07-01')}
  heroImage={undefined}
  showMeta={false}
  showEngagement={false}
>
  <section class="project-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Project OS</p>
    <h2>项目看板</h2>
    <p>
      这里展示我正在用 AI 长期推进的公开项目。它不是简历式罗列，而是一个持续运行的项目组合：写作、学习、投研、记忆、RAG、内容系统和本站获客，每条线都只展示脱敏后的方法、进度和可复用经验。
    </p>
    <div class="project-summary" aria-label="项目组合摘要">
      <div>
        <strong>{projectTracks.length}</strong>
        <span>公开项目线</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>4</strong>
        <span>证据等级</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>AI-only</strong>
        <span>站点主题</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rules-panel" aria-label="公开边界">
    <h2>项目公开规则</h2>
    <ul>
      {operatingRules.map((rule) => <li>{rule}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="evidence-panel" aria-label="证据等级说明">
    <h2>证据等级说明</h2>
    <div class="evidence-levels">
      {evidenceLevels.map((item) => (
        <article>
          <strong>{item.level}</strong>
          <p>{item.meaning}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="milestone-panel" aria-label="本月公开里程碑">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Monthly Build</p>
      <h2>本月公开里程碑</h2>
      <p>这些不是内部工作记录，而是可以公开展示的站点资产：文章、模板、样例库和自测入口。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="milestone-grid">
      {monthlyMilestones.map((milestone) => (
        <article>
          <span>{milestone.label}</span>
          <h3>{milestone.title}</h3>
          <p>{milestone.detail}</p>
          <a href={milestone.route}>{milestone.action}</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ops-panel" aria-label="公开运营看板">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Public Operations</p>
      <h2>公开运营看板</h2>
      <p>
        项目进度要能持续维护。这里不展示内部任务，只记录最近公开更新、下一次检查点、服务入口和暂缓边界，让读者能判断这些项目如何转成可咨询问题。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="ops-grid">
      {opsUpdates.map((item) => (
        <article class="ops-card">
          <div class="ops-card-head">
            <h3>{item.lane}</h3>
            <span>{item.status}</span>
          </div>
          <dl>
            <div>
              <dt>最近公开更新</dt>
              <dd>{item.latest}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>下次检查点</dt>
              <dd>{item.nextCheck}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>服务入口</dt>
              <dd><a href={item.href}>{item.serviceEntry}</a></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>暂缓边界</dt>
              <dd>{item.pause}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
          <a class="ops-action" href={item.href}>{item.action}</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="track-grid" aria-label="AI 项目进度看板">
    {projectTracks.map((project) => (
      <article>
        <div class="track-head">
          <p class="track-label">{project.label}</p>
          <span>{project.status}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{project.title}</h3>
        <p class="stage">{project.stage}</p>

        <div class="progress-block" aria-label={`${project.title} 进度 ${project.progress}%`}>
          <div class="progress-meta">
            <span>公开进度</span>
            <strong>{project.progress}%</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-track">
            <span style={`width: ${project.progress}%`}></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <dl>
          <div>
            <dt>证据等级</dt>
