          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>推进节奏</dt>
            <dd>{project.cadence}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>公开证据</dt>
            <dd><a href={project.href}>{project.publicEvidence}</a></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>下一步</dt>
            <dd>{project.next}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>可咨询方向</dt>
            <dd>{project.canConsult}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>不公开</dt>
            <dd>{project.boundary}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <div class="track-actions" aria-label={`${project.title} 下一步`}>
          <a href={project.href}>查看公开证据</a>
          <a href="/diagnosis">带类似问题自测</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="service-map-panel" aria-label="项目到服务映射">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">From Project To Offer</p>
      <h2>项目到服务映射</h2>
      <p>我把自己的 AI 项目当作公开实验场。外部需求不照搬我的项目，而是抽取其中可复用的流程、验收标准和边界。</p>
    </div>
